---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="JC Suchite Construction is dedicated to client satisfaction — punctual, knowledgeable, licensed and insured remodeling contractors serving Greater Los Angeles and Santa Clarita.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Who We Are</span>
      <h1>About JC Suchite Construction</h1>
      <p class="lead">JC Suchite Construction is completely dedicated to client satisfaction. All of our team members are punctual and knowledgeable, helping make us some of the most trusted contractors in the industry. We’ve come a long way since our founding, but the operating values behind our services — to work with integrity in order to provide high-quality services to our clients — remain unchanged. Please get in touch with any inquiries, and be sure to include your contact information as well as any important details about your needs.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">How We Work</span>
        <h2>Our Process</h2>
        <p class="lead">With pure dedication to the finest craftsmanship, clients can consistently expect a solid commitment to quality, strong work ethic, and punctuality. Our personalized options and wide range of prices cater to every budget, so you’re sure to find the solutions you need. Take a look at the services we offer and get in touch today.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/services">Our Services</a>
      </div>
      <Photo file="IMG_2406.jpeg" alt="Exterior project by JC Suchite Construction" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step"><span class="num">01</span><h3>Preconstruction Design</h3><p>We help you shape the plan before work begins — layout, materials and finishes that fit your home and your budget.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="num">02</span><h3>Design & Construction Estimate</h3><p>A clear, detailed estimate so you know the scope, the cost and the timeline up front — no surprises.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="num">03</span><h3>On-Site Consultations</h3><p>We meet you at your home to see the space in person, answer questions and talk through options — free of charge.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="num">04</span><h3>The Finishing Touches</h3><p>The details make the difference. We see every project through to a clean, careful finish and a final walkthrough with you.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our Promise</span>
      <h2>Our Quality Guarantee</h2>
      <p class="lead">JC Suchite Construction has always operated under strong values aimed at exceeding client needs. Our communication channels are always open — our relationship with our clients begins on the first day of contact, and only ends once they’re fully satisfied with our work. When you hire our services, you can count on us for the results you want and need. Get in touch today, and discover the advantage of working with JC Suchite Construction.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTA />
</Base>
